{"id":1121001,"name":"미라·심문 I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"미라·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1121001]}],"trial":{"trial_id":121001,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2024-11-26 14:00:00","diary1":"최근 MBCC와 FAC는 한 건의 심각한 큐브 밀수 사건을 처리하기 위해 합동수사에 착수했다. 당신은 FAC가 확보한 단서를 토대로 상습 밀수범을 추적했고, 그렇게 화이트 샌드에 위치한, 잘 알려지지 않은 마을인 투코에 도착했다.","diary2":"여기저기 알아본 후, 당신은 마을의 여관 사장 미라가 사건과 관련이 있음을 확신했다. 당신은 미라의 여관에 묵으며 한밤중에 조사에 착수했지만, 실수로 함정에 빠지고 말았다.\n　　그런데 생각지도 못한 일이 벌어졌다. 미라가 때마침 위급한 상황에 나타나 비상 통로의 함정에서 당신을 구해준 것이었다.","evidence":[{"ID":260657,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260658,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221001022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course